/*!
@defgroup edma_soc EDMA SOC Driver
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides SoC-specific definitions for the eDMA driver
on MCUXpresso SDK devices.

The eDMA SOC layer supplies the device-level glue used by the generic eDMA
driver, including:
  - eDMA3 / eDMA5 IP version flags (FSL_EDMA_SOC_IP_DMA3, FSL_EDMA_SOC_IP_DMA5)
  - The EDMA_BASE_PTRS table covering MAIN_EDMA3, MAIN_EDMA5, AUDIO_EDMA3 and
    WAKE_EDMA3
  - Per-channel IRQ tables (EDMA_CHN_IRQS) for each eDMA instance
  - Helper inline functions used by the generic eDMA driver to translate
    channel/instance numbers into base addresses and IRQ numbers

*/
